<h3 data-start=3D"2085" data-end=3D"2137" class=3D"">2. Explication d=C3=A9=
taill=C3=A9e des dossiers principaux</h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"2139" data-end=3D"2153" class=3D"">a) <code data-start=3D=
"2147" data-end=3D"2153">app/</code></h4>
<p data-start=3D"2155" data-end=3D"2330" class=3D"">Le dossier <code data-s=
tart=3D"2166" data-end=3D"2172">app/</code> est le c=C5=93ur de votre appli=
cation. C'est ici que se trouvent la majorit=C3=A9 des classes PHP utilis=
=C3=A9es par l'application. Vous y trouverez les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments suivant=
s :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2332" data-end=3D"3353">
<li data-start=3D"2332" data-end=3D"2397" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2334" data-end=3D"2397" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
334" data-end=3D"2348"><code data-start=3D"2336" data-end=3D"2346">Console/=
</code></strong> : Contient les commandes artisan personnalis=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2398" data-end=3D"2537" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2400" data-end=3D"2537" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
400" data-end=3D"2417"><code data-start=3D"2402" data-end=3D"2415">Exceptio=
ns/</code></strong> : Contient la gestion des exceptions de votre applicati=
on. Vous pouvez y ajouter vos propres exceptions personnalis=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2538" data-end=3D"3007" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2540" data-end=3D"2634" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
540" data-end=3D"2551"><code data-start=3D"2542" data-end=3D"2549">Http/</c=
ode></strong> : C'est ici que r=C3=A9sident les contr=C3=B4leurs, middlewar=
e, requ=C3=AAtes et ressources HTTP.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2637" data-end=3D"3007">
<li data-start=3D"2637" data-end=3D"2728" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2639" data-end=3D"2728" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
639" data-end=3D"2657"><code data-start=3D"2641" data-end=3D"2655">Controll=
ers/</code></strong> : Contient les contr=C3=B4leurs pour g=C3=A9rer la log=
ique de votre application.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2731" data-end=3D"2861" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2733" data-end=3D"2861" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
733" data-end=3D"2750"><code data-start=3D"2735" data-end=3D"2748">Middlewa=
re/</code></strong> : Contient les middleware utilis=C3=A9s pour traiter le=
s requ=C3=AAtes HTTP avant qu'elles n'atteignent vos contr=C3=B4leurs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2864" data-end=3D"2951" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2866" data-end=3D"2951" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
866" data-end=3D"2881"><code data-start=3D"2868" data-end=3D"2879">Requests=
/</code></strong> : Contient les classes de validation des formulaires ou d=
es requ=C3=AAtes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2954" data-end=3D"3004" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2956" data-end=3D"3004" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
956" data-end=3D"2972"><code data-start=3D"2958" data-end=3D"2970">Resource=
s/</code></strong> : Contient les ressources HTTP.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3008" data-end=3D"3178" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3010" data-end=3D"3178" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
010" data-end=3D"3023"><code data-start=3D"3012" data-end=3D"3021">Models/<=
/code></strong> : Contient les mod=C3=A8les Eloquent utilis=C3=A9s pour int=
eragir avec la base de donn=C3=A9es. Les mod=C3=A8les repr=C3=A9sentent g=
=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralement des tables dans la base de donn=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3179" data-end=3D"3353" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3181" data-end=3D"3353" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
181" data-end=3D"3197"><code data-start=3D"3183" data-end=3D"3195">Provider=
s/</code></strong> : Contient les fournisseurs de services (service provide=
rs) qui sont responsables de l=E2=80=99enregistrement de services dans le c=
onteneur de services de Laravel.</p>
</li>
</ul>
