<p data-start=3D"2328" data-end=3D"2367" class=3D"">Les sous-dossiers princ=
ipaux ici sont :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2368" data-end=3D"2886">
<li data-start=3D"2368" data-end=3D"2468" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2370" data-end=3D"2468" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
370" data-end=3D"2386">Controllers/</strong> : Les contr=C3=B4leurs qui con=
tiennent la logique m=C3=A9tier qui r=C3=A9pond aux requ=C3=AAtes HTTP.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2469" data-end=3D"2613" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2471" data-end=3D"2613" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
471" data-end=3D"2486">Middleware/</strong> : Les middleware qui permettent=
 de filtrer ou de modifier les requ=C3=AAtes HTTP avant qu'elles ne soient =
envoy=C3=A9es =C3=A0 un contr=C3=B4leur.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2614" data-end=3D"2753" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2616" data-end=3D"2753" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
616" data-end=3D"2629">Requests/</strong> : Les classes de validation des r=
equ=C3=AAtes. Elles permettent de valider les donn=C3=A9es envoy=C3=A9es da=
ns les formulaires ou les API.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2754" data-end=3D"2886" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2756" data-end=3D"2886" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
756" data-end=3D"2770">Resources/</strong> : Si vous avez des ressources de=
 type API, ce r=C3=A9pertoire contient les transformateurs de donn=C3=A9es =
pour les r=C3=A9ponses.</p>
</li>
</ul>
