saires =C3=A0 la base de donn=C3=A9es. La table <strong data-start=3D"6811"=
 data-end=3D"6827"><code data-start=3D"6813" data-end=3D"6825">migrations</=
code></strong> est =C3=A9galement cr=C3=A9=C3=A9e dans la base de donn=C3=
=A9es pour garder une trace de celles qui ont =C3=A9t=C3=A9 ex=C3=A9cut=C3=
=A9es.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"6928" data-end=3D"6949" class=3D"">b) <strong data-start=
=3D"6936" data-end=3D"6947">Seeders</strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"6950" data-end=3D"7102" class=3D"">Apr=C3=A8s avoir ex=C3=
